1. e4 e6 (1... e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Bc5 4. d3 Nf6 5. O-O O-O {Normally, king safety simply means castling, either short or long. But do not confuse the two: king safety and castling are not the same thing!}) 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3
Nf6 4. e5 Nfd7 5. f4 c5 6. Nce2 Nc6 7. c3 b5 8. a3 c4 {... Game Rafiee, M (2300)–Krassowizkij, J (2450), 2017. The kings are already safe; they do not need to castle. The middlegame begins, together with the middlegame rules.} *

